sequenceDiagram
  participant Main as MainActivity actor owner
  participant Align as TimestampAlignedWalkingCalibration
  participant Segment as WalkingCalibrationSegmentPolicy
  participant Profile as PedestrianMotionProfile
  participant Writer as SerialPedestrianProfileWriter
  participant Store as Encrypted actor store
  Note over Main,Store: F-D04-019부터 F-D04-022 보정 및 actor 고정 저장
  Main->>Align: HIGH single step 원 시각·receipt
  Main->>Align: accepted non-downweighted raw GNSS endpoint
  alt step watermark가 fix보다 뒤이고 bracket·gap·wait 검증 통과
    Align->>Segment: timestamp-aligned raw endpoint
    Segment->>Segment: quality·straightness·duration·step·distance gate
    alt 유효 segment 완성
      Segment->>Profile: validated calibration sample
      Profile->>Profile: 3 samples warmup / 최근7 robust bounded EWMA
      Profile-->>Main: updated profile
      Main->>Writer: submit actor와 profile 고정
      Writer->>Writer: actor별 아직 대기중 값만 최신으로 합침
      Writer->>Store: 단일 IO queue save
      Store-->>Writer: commit 결과
    end
  else newestStep가 fix 이하
    Align->>Align: bounded pending WAITING
  else watermark 이후 bracket 또는 2초 gap/wait 조건 실패
    Align->>Align: dequeue / segment reset / REJECTED
  end
  Main->>Writer: actor 변경 시 pending profile 조회
  Main->>Store: loadResult / schema validation·migration
  Store-->>Main: valid profile / reset-invalid / blocked
  Main->>Writer: clearPendingAndRun reset barrier
  Writer->>Writer: pending clear / 실행중 save 뒤 배치
  Writer->>Store: reset all
  Writer-->>Main: 최대10초 대기 결과
  Note over Writer,Main: timeout false는 이미 제출된 reset 취소가 아님
